### Base exclusions

node_modules
_.log
npm-debug.log_
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log\*
\*.tsbuildinfo

### Environment & secrets

.env
.env.\*
!.env.example

### VCS

.git
.gitignore

### IDE & tooling

.vscode
.idea

